  "releaseNotes": "v2.5.0:\n- GetColumnTypeSql resolves SqlColumnType to concrete SQL Server DDL types (nvarchar(n), decimal(p,s), datetime2, ...).\n- Session temp-table DDL: CREATE TABLE #Name (...).\n- SqlBulkCopy-backed bulk copy executor for DapperSet.BulkCopyAsync / DapperDbContext.BulkCopyAsync.\n\nv2.2.0:\n- BulkInsertAsync and BulkMergeAsync (uses SQL Server MERGE statement).\n- Include/ThenInclude Where filter support.",
